, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JvawJ9bSr22xn4R9oLvl_w","review_id":"nqPddLgNzV39V2rD_DzuYA","date":"2015-06-08T11:32:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9484527707099915,"text_excerpt":"Grilled oysters people!! And crab Mac-n-cheese was delicious too. We stopped in for a drink and a snack and wow I'm glad we did! We didn't find it online however wondered in here within our first hour of being in New Orleans. This place is super clean with a very attentive staff. It wasn't too busy but then we did come in at slow hours (230-330pm) I would absolutely come back here for some good eats!"},{"business_id":"JvawJ9bSr22xn4R9oLvl_w","review_id":"2YlBydd1CllUJHXDPWkJ3g","date":"2011-11-30T22:30:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9413414001464844,"text_excerpt":"Connected to our hotel - lucky us. We ate here twice during our stay. First time, we had the combo patter (jambalaya, gumbo, and red beans and rice). Excellent sampling of everything, and our fave was the gumbo. Super salty, but then again, isn't everything in NOLA? Second time, we tried the BBQ oysters. Incredible. My dining companion - who is terrified of oysters - was even able to swallow these. When you put bleu cheese, bbq sauce, and fry the oyster, it makes for quite a scrumdidlyumptious treat. I had the boiled shrimp - fresh and one of my only healthy meals during my vacation. Great service, nice people watching."},{"business_id":"JvawJ9bSr22xn4R9oLvl_w","review_id":"XZJOSJ0Sl1NpSxHzt9ezUA","date":"2016-11-17T00:44:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402666687965393,"text_excerpt":"I had one of the best meals here in my recent stay in NOLA. My boyfriend and I tried charbroiled oysters at pretty much every place we could, and Desire was the only place that came close to the wonder and marvel of Drago's. The gumbo here was also one of my favorites in the city, and I definitely tried my fair share. We also shared crab mac and cheese, which of course was delicious, because how could it not be. Finally, we shared a shrimp carbonara po boy...so good! It was different from your basic bitch po boy since it had that delicious carbonara sauce on it. I would never think to make that combination, but I'm glad someone did because it definitely worked. We had to end this great lu..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JvawJ9bSr22xn4R9oLvl_w","photo_id":"rqRLQYzWOn610INnc_pJpw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/rqRLQYzWOn610INnc_pJpw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8559731245040894},{"business_id":"JvawJ9bSr22xn4R9oLvl_w","photo_id":"aVTd5zDlR968VDrTk8KT9Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aVTd5zDlR968VDrTk8KT9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8354425430297852},{"business_id":"JvawJ9bSr22xn4R9oLvl_w","photo_id":"Pk0k35pYqgskdma2U2z-xg","label":"inside","image_url":"/ph